From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Almeida Barrios <gabarrios2006@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:58:07 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] calls: video and group calls through meowcaller

CallDialWith (voice or video), CallGroupDial (every member of a group),
CallVideo (ask for / accept an upgrade, stop, camera on/off),
CallWriteVideo / CallReadVideo (H.264 Annex-B access units each way) and
CallInfo; events video, keyframe and group; incoming carries video and
group. Python: Calls.dial(video=), group_dial, video, write_video,
read_video, info.
